sequenceDiagram
  participant S as Capteur IoT
  participant CV as CheckVenueCapacityUseCase
  participant VR as VenueRepository
  participant MP as MqttEventPublisher
  participant D as Dashboard

  Note over VR: currentOccupancy = 475 (95%)
  MP->>D: publish(CAPACITY_WARNING, occupancyRate=0.95) → /capacity
  D->>D: updateOccupancy(475, 500) — barre orange

  Note over VR: currentOccupancy = 500 (100%)
  MP->>D: publish(CAPACITY_EXCEEDED, occupancyRate=1.0) → /capacity
  D->>D: updateOccupancy(500, 500) — barre rouge

  S->>S: onTicketDetected() → READING
  S->>S: onReadSuccess() → PROCESSING
  S->>CV: execute("venue-grand-palais")
  CV->>VR: findById(venueId)
  VR-->>CV: Venue { occupancy: 500/500 }
  CV-->>S: { hasCapacity: false, error: VenueAtCapacityError }
  S->>MP: publish(DENIED, reason=VENUE_FULL) → /access
  MP->>D: broadcast via WebSocket
  D->>D: appendEvent(DENIED, TKT-2026-VALID-099 (VALID))
  S->>S: onAccessDenied() → DENIED
  Note over S: 3 secondes
  S->>S: onReset() → IDLE
